window.__T__=[{"i":10160,"text":"{\"type\":\"side-by-side fantasy creature illustration and collectible trading card mockup\",\"canvas\":\"wide 16:9 composition with a clean white background on the left half and a finished ornate card design on the right half, separated by a narrow vertical gap\",\"subject\":{\"creature name\":\"{argument name=\\\"creature name\\\" default=\\\"不死鳥\\\"}\",\"species\":\"mythic phoenix yokai monster\",\"appearance\":\"large demonic phoenix with shaggy black and crimson body, huge ragged flame-shaped wings, curled tail plumes, taloned feet, sharp beak-like face, horn-like head feathers, glowing yellow-orange flame accents, heavy black ink outlines, dynamic aggressive crouching pose\",\"color palette\":\"{argument name=\\\"creature color palette\\\" default=\\\"deep black, crimson red, hot pink flame feathers, orange and yellow fire highlights, antique gold ornaments\\\"}\",\"style\":\"Japanese dark fantasy game art, bold manga-like linework, intricate feathers, high contrast, fiery supernatural energy\"},\"layout\":{\"panel count\":2,\"panels\":[{\"position\":\"left half\",\"description\":\"standalone full-body monster illustration on plain white, no frame, centered with ample whitespace, showing the phoenix in a three-quarter crouch with both wings spread wide\"},{\"position\":\"right half\",\"description\":\"vertical collectible card version of the same phoenix, framed inside an ornate antique gold and dark red border, with swirling red fire vortex background behind the creature\"}]},\"card design\":{\"orientation\":\"portrait\",\"border\":\"luxurious embossed gold filigree frame with floral corner ornaments, dark lacquer-red panels, black inner outline, decorative gold trim\",\"background\":\"burning circular vortex of red, orange, and black flames, glowing sparks, dramatic magical atmosphere\",\"main art\":\"phoenix centered in the upper art window, wings arcing around the body and blending with flame shapes\",\"visible labeled elements count\":8,\"visible labeled elements\":[{\"element\":\"top-left circular crest\",\"text\":\"gold three-leaf or three-petal emblem inside a red medallion\"},{\"element\":\"right vertical rarity plaque\",\"text\":\"{argument name=\\\"rarity label\\\" default=\\\"伝説\\\"}\"},{\"element\":\"left vertical name plaque\",\"text\":\"{argument name=\\\"card name\\\" default=\\\"不死鳥\\\"}\",\"small reading\":\"ふしちょう\"},{\"element\":\"bottom-left diamond type icon\",\"text\":\"妖\"},{\"element\":\"lore text box\",\"text\":\"{argument name=\\\"flavor text\\\" default=\\\"炎の中で甦り、永遠に命を繋ぐ神鳥。その羽ばたきは天を焦がし、全てを焼き尽くし、再生をもたらす。\\\"}\"},{\"element\":\"bottom stat diamond 1\",\"label\":\"武\",\"value\":\"98\"},{\"element\":\"bottom stat diamond 2\",\"label\":\"知\",\"value\":\"92\"},{\"element\":\"bottom stat diamond 3\",\"label\":\"魅\",\"value\":\"97\"}],\"bottom-right emblem\":\"large glossy red circular swirl crest set in an ornate gold mount\",\"typography\":\"vertical Japanese calligraphy in metallic gold on red plaques, smaller white Japanese lore text, stat numbers in bright white with gold diamond labels\",\"finish\":\"premium trading card look with embossed metallic gold, glossy highlights, dark fantasy TCG aesthetics\"},\"rendering instructions\":\"Create a polished concept presentation: the left image should look like the original mascot/creature artwork, while the right image should look like a completed high-rarity Japanese fantasy trading card featuring that same creature. Keep the left panel clean and white, make the right card highly detailed, ornate, fiery, and dramatic. Ensure all 8 visible labeled card elements are present and legible.\"}","imgs":["https://r2.qqsrc.com/images/originals/18179.jpg"]},{"i":10161,"text":"{\"type\":\"side-by-side fantasy game asset presentation\",\"canvas\":\"wide 16:9 composition on a clean white background, split into two main panels separated by empty white space\",\"style\":\"high-detail Japanese collectible trading card art, dark fantasy ink illustration, ornate gold filigree, deep sapphire and electric blue palette, dramatic lightning and swirling water effects, crisp linework, glossy premium card finish\",\"subject\":{\"creature\":\"a powerful coiled blue dragon deity with black antler-like horns, red glowing eyes, white flowing whiskers and beard, cream segmented belly scales, sharp claws, black flame-like spines, fierce snarling expression\",\"theme\":\"eastern guardian dragon, divine water and storm power\",\"main colors\":\"{argument name=\\\"dragon color palette\\\" default=\\\"deep cobalt blue, black, cream, white, red accents\\\"}\"},\"layout\":{\"total discrete main elements\":2,\"elements\":[{\"position\":\"left half\",\"type\":\"standalone mascot logo illustration\",\"description\":\"the same blue dragon shown as a compact emblem-like character with thick black outline, coiled body, raised claw, aggressive face, simplified but detailed scales, no frame, isolated on white background\"},{\"position\":\"right half\",\"type\":\"complete vertical trading card\",\"description\":\"ornate Japanese fantasy card containing the dragon in a stormy circular composition, framed by elaborate antique gold borders and dark navy patterned panels\"}]},\"trading_card\":{\"shape\":\"portrait card with rounded corners and thick black outer edge\",\"border\":\"complex gold ornamental frame with curled filigree in all corners, jewel-like medallions, decorative chains, engraved patterns\",\"art_window\":\"large central illustration of the blue dragon coiling through a vortex of waves, clouds, blue lightning, and magical energy\",\"visible text count\":10,\"visible text items\":[{\"location\":\"left vertical name plaque\",\"text\":\"{argument name=\\\"card name\\\" default=\\\"青龍\\\"}\",\"notes\":\"large gold Japanese calligraphy with small furigana reading せい and りゅう\"},{\"location\":\"right vertical rarity plaque\",\"text\":\"{argument name=\\\"rarity label\\\" default=\\\"伝説\\\"}\",\"notes\":\"gold Japanese text on a hanging black plaque\"},{\"location\":\"diamond class badge under name\",\"text\":\"{argument name=\\\"class label\\\" default=\\\"神\\\"}\"},{\"location\":\"lore line 1\",\"text\":\"東方を守護する四神の蒼き神。\"},{\"location\":\"lore line 2\",\"text\":\"その力は天を裂き、雨を呼び、万物を潤す。\"},{\"location\":\"lore line 3\",\"text\":\"いかなる敵もその怒りの前にはひれ伏すのみ。\"},{\"location\":\"bottom left stat label\",\"text\":\"武\"},{\"location\":\"bottom left stat value\",\"text\":\"97\"},{\"location\":\"bottom center stat label and value\",\"text\":\"知 91\"},{\"location\":\"bottom right stat label and value\",\"text\":\"魅 96\"}],\"icon count\":5,\"icons\":[\"top-left circular gold flower crest medallion\",\"right-side hanging rarity plaque ornament\",\"diamond class badge marked 神\",\"bottom-left diamond stat badge marked 武\",\"bottom-right circular blue water swirl emblem\"],\"stats\":{\"count\":3,\"items\":[{\"label\":\"武\",\"value\":\"97\"},{\"label\":\"知\",\"value\":\"91\"},{\"label\":\"魅\",\"value\":\"96\"}]},\"bottom_panel\":\"dark navy text box with subtle wave pattern, three Japanese lore lines, and three stat diamonds integrated into the gold frame\",\"lighting\":\"high contrast, glowing electric blue highlights, metallic gold shine, dramatic shadows\"},\"rendering_instructions\":\"Generate a polished image that looks like a comparison between an original dragon mascot/logo on the left and its finished collectible card version on the right. Keep the left dragon isolated and smaller, and make the right card highly ornate, premium, readable, and packed with Japanese fantasy-card details. Use sharp outlines and saturated blues, with luxurious gold decoration and storm-water magic effects.\"}","imgs":["https://r2.qqsrc.com/images/originals/18180.jpg"]},{"i":10162,"text":"{\"type\":\"side-by-side mascot logo and fantasy trading card design\",\"canvas\":\"wide horizontal image split into 2 equal panels on a clean white background, left panel showing the standalone mascot illustration, right panel showing the finished ornate collectible card\",\"style\":\"high-detail Japanese yokai illustration, bold black vector-ink outlines, white and gold palette with red flame markings, premium trading card frame, ornate gold filigree, ukiyo-e and modern card-game fusion\",\"subject\":{\"name\":\"{argument name=\\\"creature name\\\" default=\\\"九尾の狐\\\"}\",\"creature\":\"nine-tailed fox yokai curled into a circular sleeping or coiled pose, sharp claws, pointed ears, multiple large fluffy tails wrapped around the body\",\"colors\":\"{argument name=\\\"creature colors\\\" default=\\\"ivory white fur, gray shadows, black outlines, bright yellow accents, red flame markings\\\"}\",\"expression\":\"fierce narrowed yellow eyes, aggressive mythical aura\",\"pose\":\"compact curled body with all 9 tails fanning upward and around it; count exactly 9 tails, each with red flame tips and yellow highlights\"},\"left_panel\":{\"position\":\"left half\",\"background\":\"plain white\",\"content\":\"single isolated mascot logo of the nine-tailed fox, no card frame, centered with ample whitespace\",\"counted_elements\":{\"main_creature\":1,\"tails\":9}},\"right_panel\":{\"position\":\"right half\",\"background\":\"full vertical trading card occupying most of the panel\",\"card\":{\"rarity_label\":\"{argument name=\\\"rarity label\\\" default=\\\"伝説\\\"}\",\"title\":\"{argument name=\\\"card title\\\" default=\\\"九尾の狐\\\"}\",\"type_badge\":\"妖\",\"main_art\":\"same nine-tailed fox mascot centered inside the card art window over a pale parchment background with sweeping gold brush-circle texture\",\"frame\":\"thick black outer border, layered metallic gold inner borders, antique cream parchment panels, corner ornaments, floral chrysanthemum motifs, tassel charm decoration, circular gold crest at top-left, circular coin-like emblem at lower-right\",\"text_area\":{\"headline\":\"天を焦がす神秘の妖狐\",\"body\":\"その尾、九つにして灼熱を纏う。幻術自在にして、味方を導き、敵を滅す。\"},\"bottom_stats\":{\"count\":3,\"stats\":[{\"label\":\"武\",\"value\":\"95\",\"icon\":\"gold diamond badge\"},{\"label\":\"知\",\"value\":\"90\",\"icon\":\"gold diamond badge\"},{\"label\":\"魅\",\"value\":\"97\",\"icon\":\"gold diamond badge\"}]},\"counted_elements\":{\"vertical_title_panel\":1,\"rarity_tag\":1,\"type_badge\":1,\"stat_badges\":3,\"stat_values\":3,\"large_circular_crests\":2,\"main_creature\":1,\"tails\":9}}},\"composition_notes\":\"Maintain the left mascot and right card as clearly separate versions of the same design. Make the Japanese calligraphy legible and vertically arranged on the card title panel. Use crisp print-ready details, clean high contrast, premium collectible card aesthetics, no extra characters, no mockup hands, no perspective tilt.\"}","imgs":["https://r2.qqsrc.com/images/originals/18181.jpg"]},{"i":10163,"text":"{\"type\":\"ultra rare Japanese trading card game character card\",\"style\":\"premium anime fantasy TCG card, glossy holographic rainbow foil, ornate black and gold frame, highly detailed illustration, dramatic magical lighting, crisp printed typography, collectible card layout\",\"canvas\":\"vertical 2:3 card with rounded corners and thick metallic gold border\",\"character\":{\"name\":\"{argument name=\\\"character name\\\" default=\\\"想像神ちゃん\\\"}\",\"reading\":\"そううぞうしん\",\"role\":\"cute childlike imagination deity\",\"appearance\":\"small anime girl floating in space, pale skin, short bob haircut with blonde-to-ash-blue gradient, blue eyes, calm slightly unimpressed expression, two flower hair clips on the right side, one red flower and one pale daisy\",\"outfit\":\"oversized white hoodie with colorful patchwork sleeves, geometric multicolor buttons and pixel motifs, red shorts or skirt, white socks with blue bands, red-and-green sneakers\",\"pose\":\"seated weightless pose, legs extended forward, both hands open as if creating worlds\"},\"main_art\":{\"background\":\"cosmic blue and violet vortex with sparkling stars, aurora rainbow light, circular portal behind the character\",\"world_objects\":{\"count\":8,\"items\":[\"top-left translucent cube world with rainbow city texture\",\"left-middle floating castle island above the character hand\",\"upper-right green-blue floating cube fragment\",\"right red crystal cube\",\"right-middle large green village island\",\"lower-left castle island partly behind vertical text\",\"lower-center ocean cube with a white city\",\"bottom-center green fantasy island\"]},\"mood\":\"godlike but adorable, world-creation magic, overwhelming power\"},\"card_layout\":{\"top_left\":{\"rarity\":\"UUR\",\"star_count\":5,\"description\":\"large rainbow-gradient UUR letters with five rainbow stars beneath\"},\"top_center\":{\"title\":\"{argument name=\\\"card title\\\" default=\\\"想像神ちゃん\\\"}\",\"subtitle\":\"～世界を想像して創造する神様～\"},\"top_right\":{\"class_icon\":\"神\",\"attribute_label\":\"属性：想像\"},\"left_vertical_quote\":\"{argument name=\\\"vertical quote\\\" default=\\\"想像は、世界を創るいちばんの魔法。\\\"}\",\"stats_panel\":{\"position\":\"lower right\",\"level\":\"LV. 99/99\",\"count\":5,\"stats\":[{\"label\":\"想像力\",\"value\":\"9999\"},{\"label\":\"創造力\",\"value\":\"9999\"},{\"label\":\"発想力\",\"value\":\"9999\"},{\"label\":\"共感力\",\"value\":\"9999\"},{\"label\":\"無限力\",\"value\":\"∞\"}]},\"ability_panels\":{\"position\":\"lower left\",\"count\":2,\"abilities\":[{\"header\":\"必殺技\",\"name\":\"イマジネーション・ジェネシス\",\"description\":\"カード全体に無限の可能性を広げる光を放ち、すべての想像を現実に変える。\"},{\"header\":\"神の力\",\"name\":\"インフィニット・ワールド\",\"description\":\"このカードが場にある限り、プレイヤーは毎ターン新しい世界を創造できる。\"}]},\"profile_panel\":{\"position\":\"lower right below stats\",\"title\":\"プロフィール\",\"text\":\"世界のあらゆる「はじまり」を想像することで生み出した神様。退屈が大嫌いで、いつも新しいアイデアを探している。『一緒に、なにか想像してみる？』\"},\"footer\":{\"count\":4,\"items\":[\"種族：神\",\"性別：なし\",\"イラスト：想像神の世界\",\"IG-0001-UUR\"]}},\"rendering_notes\":\"Make the card look like a real high-rarity Japanese mobile game trading card, with gold filigree corners, black enamel UI boxes, white Japanese text, rainbow foil reflections, tiny sparkles, and ultra-sharp anime line art. Do not include any external watermark.\"}","imgs":["https://r2.qqsrc.com/images/originals/18182.jpg"]},{"i":10164,"text":"{\"type\":\"architectural sketchbook collage\",\"medium\":\"blue ballpoint pen and ink on warm off-white paper\",\"style\":\"observational travel sketch, detailed hand-drawn linework, cross-hatching, architectural study notes, loose perspective construction lines, monochrome cobalt blue ink\",\"subject\":{\"building\":\"{argument name=\\\"building name\\\" default=\\\"Säynätsalo Town Hall\\\"}\",\"architect\":\"{argument name=\\\"architect name\\\" default=\\\"Alvar Aalto\\\"}\",\"year\":\"{argument name=\\\"year text\\\" default=\\\"1952\\\"}\",\"theme\":\"Nordic modernist civic architecture, brick, timber, glass, pine forest, courtyard stairs, handmade architectural details\"},\"canvas\":{\"aspect_ratio\":\"4:3 landscape\",\"background\":\"cream sketchbook paper with subtle paper texture\",\"composition\":\"one page filled edge to edge with eight integrated sketch studies, overlapping but separated by soft margins and implied panel boundaries\"},\"layout\":{\"handwritten_title\":{\"position\":\"upper left\",\"text_lines\":[\"SÄYNÄTSALO\",\"TOWN HALL\",\"ALVAR AALTO\",\"1952\"],\"style\":\"small uppercase blue handwritten lettering\"},\"sections\":[{\"position\":\"upper left to center-left\",\"count\":1,\"description\":\"large exterior street view of the town hall among tall pine trees, brick and dark timber volumes, parked car in foreground, outdoor café umbrellas and stairs near entrance\"},{\"position\":\"upper center\",\"count\":1,\"description\":\"prominent blocky brick tower and adjacent lower building, tall trees behind, exterior staircase and lamp posts, dense horizontal brick hatching\"},{\"position\":\"upper right\",\"count\":1,\"description\":\"long rectilinear courtyard walkway with benches along both sides, tall window walls, planters, geometric paving, vertical façade rhythm and potted plants\"},{\"position\":\"lower left\",\"count\":1,\"description\":\"close-up of a wooden double door with vertical grain, two curved sculptural pull handles, round lock hardware, small sign on left reading STOP Lokauto Salli\"},{\"position\":\"center\",\"count\":1,\"description\":\"radial wooden ceiling or roof structure detail seen from below, beams radiating from a dark square central opening, small hanging pendant lights\"},{\"position\":\"middle right\",\"count\":1,\"description\":\"brick stair detail with metal handrail and brackets, handwritten note beside it reading LIGHT, MATERIALS, RHYTHM.\"},{\"position\":\"lower center\",\"count\":1,\"description\":\"small interior study of a simple table or lectern against brick walls and wood floor, with tools or papers on top, handwritten note reading WOOD, BRICK NATURE. AALTO.\"},{\"position\":\"lower right\",\"count\":1,\"description\":\"outdoor terraced steps and planted slope beside brick walls, forest path, lamp post, round drain cover, perspective lines leading into trees\"}],\"total_sketch_panels\":8,\"visible_notes_count\":4,\"visible_notes\":[\"SÄYNÄTSALO TOWN HALL ALVAR AALTO 1952\",\"STOP Lokauto Salli\",\"LIGHT, MATERIALS, RHYTHM.\",\"WOOD, BRICK NATURE. AALTO.\"]},\"rendering_instructions\":\"Use only blue ink lines, no watercolor or color fill. Emphasize architectural material textures: brick courses, vertical wood grain, paving grids, pine needles, foliage, railings, and shadows through hatching. Keep the sketches cohesive as if drawn on a single travel sketchbook page, with realistic but slightly imperfect hand perspective and handwritten annotations. No photorealism, no clean CAD lines, no digital UI elements.\",\"customization\":{\"ink_color\":\"{argument name=\\\"ink color\\\" default=\\\"cobalt blue\\\"}\",\"paper_color\":\"{argument name=\\\"paper color\\\" default=\\\"warm off-white\\\"}\"}}","imgs":["https://r2.qqsrc.com/images/originals/18184.jpg"]},{"i":10165,"text":"Using the provided reference image as the UI/data source, redesign it into a polished retro-futuristic monochrome green terminal HUD for an M5Stack-style display. Keep the same information and values unchanged: title {argument name=\"title text\" default=\"CLAUDE CODE USAGE\"}, two usage sections labeled {argument name=\"session label\" default=\"SESSION 5H\"} and {argument name=\"weekly label\" default=\"WEEKLY 7D\"}, percentages 14% and 50%, reset messages \"RESET IN 4H 9M\" and \"RESET IN 3D 3H\", and footer statuses \"CONNECTED\", \"MODE=FAST\", \"03:30\", \"CHG 100%\". Replace the plain bars with chunky pixelated segmented gauges: exactly 2 horizontal gauge panels, each with 20 rectangular segments, with the first showing 2 filled neon-green segments and the second showing 10 filled neon-green segments. Add a detailed sci-fi frame with angular borders, thin circuit-like linework, corner brackets, dotted texture, small arrow/target/clock icons, diagonal hazard stripes, and subtle CRT/pixel-grid glow. Use a black background, bright neon green outlines and fills, and white-green pixel text. Arrange the footer as exactly 3 bottom modules: left \"CONNECTED\" with a green status dot, center \"MODE=FAST\", and right \"03:30  CHG 100%\". Make it sharper, more stylish, and more production-ready than the reference while preserving the same dashboard function and data.","imgs":["https://r2.qqsrc.com/images/originals/18186.jpg"]},{"i":10166,"text":"Using REFERENCE_0 as the functional layout and data source, redesign it as a polished monochrome neon-green retro terminal UI for an M5Stack-style low-resolution display. Keep the same concept of a Claude Code usage gauge with 2 usage panels: SESSION 5H and WEEKLY 7D. Convert the plain progress bars into segmented pixel bars with 24 rectangular blocks each, preserve the approximate usage values but update the visible numbers to {argument name=\"session percentage\" default=\"18%\"} and {argument name=\"weekly percentage\" default=\"51%\"}. Add thin glowing green borders around each panel, pixel/bitmap typography, small target/crosshair icons beside the panel titles, and clock icons beside the reset lines. Replace the simple title with a decorative header reading {argument name=\"headline text\" default=\"CLAUDE CODE USAGE\"}, flanked by terminal-like slashes and line ornaments. At the bottom, add a retro status row with a flag/terminal outline icon, green connection dot, {argument name=\"connection label\" default=\"CONNECTED\"}, MODE=FAST, {argument name=\"time\" default=\"12:52\"}, and CHG 75% with a small battery/charging icon. Use a black background, bright CRT green lines, crisp pixel art styling, and make the result look like a refined embedded-device dashboard rather than a flat chart.","imgs":["https://r2.qqsrc.com/images/originals/18187.jpg"]},{"i":10167,"text":"Using the provided reference image as the functional UI base, redesign it into a polished neon-green cyberpunk terminal interface suitable for an M5Stack-style 320×240 display. Keep the same two usage meters and overall information hierarchy, but replace the plain black layout with thin glowing vector line art, angular framed panels, pixel/monospace typography, and sci-fi HUD decorations. Convert the two meters into 2 stacked framed cards: 1) “SESSION 5H” with a crosshair icon, large percentage “{argument name=\"session percent\" default=\"18%\"}”, a segmented horizontal progress bar, and a clock/reset row reading “{argument name=\"session reset text\" default=\"RESET IN 2H 40M\"}”; 2) “WEEKLY 7D” with a crosshair icon, large percentage “{argument name=\"weekly percent\" default=\"51%\"}”, a segmented horizontal progress bar, and a clock/reset row reading “{argument name=\"weekly reset text\" default=\"RESET IN 2D 17H\"}”. Add a top header reading “{argument name=\"header text\" default=\"CLAUDE CODE USAGE\"}” centered, with decorative diagonal tick marks on both sides and a small plus sign at the top right. Add a bottom status bar with exactly 5 visible items: a green status dot, “RATE_LIM”, “MODE=FAST”, “13:28”, and “CHG 75%”. Use only black background, bright green strokes, darker green grid/bar outlines, and crisp pixel-perfect rendering; make the final image look like a refined embedded-device dashboard rather than a flat mockup.","imgs":["https://r2.qqsrc.com/images/originals/18188.jpg"]},{"i":10168,"text":"Using REFERENCE_0 as the character base, extract only the main full-body standing portrait and regenerate it as a clean standalone character illustration. Preserve the character’s design, outfit, colors, hairstyle, gentle pose, and soft hand-drawn anime linework. Remove the reference-sheet layout elements: all handwritten Japanese notes, the left-side profile/settings text, and the 3 smaller expression bust panels on the right. Center the full-body figure vertically on a plain warm off-white background with generous margins, keeping a polished character-design-sheet quality.","imgs":["https://r2.qqsrc.com/images/originals/18189.jpg"]},{"i":10169,"text":"{\"type\":\"ornate anime angel character profile poster\",\"style\":\"bright celestial fantasy, polished Japanese mobile-game key visual, delicate watercolor-like lighting, gold filigree typography, soft sky-blue and ivory palette, sparkling stars, feathers, halos, elegant magazine character sheet design\",\"canvas\":{\"orientation\":\"vertical portrait\",\"aspect_ratio\":\"3:4\",\"background\":\"pale blue sky with clouds, radiant sunbeams, drifting white feathers, tiny gold stars, subtle circular halo motifs, thin ornate gold border with corner flourishes\"},\"main_character\":{\"name\":\"{argument name=\\\"character name\\\" default=\\\"大天使キャワテポン\\\"}\",\"species_role\":\"guardian angel mascot for an AI illustration posting site\",\"appearance\":\"beautiful young anime angel woman, long flowing golden-blonde hair, small silver tiara, large soft white feathered wings, glowing white halo above head, gentle graceful expression, fair skin\",\"outfit\":\"strapless white bridal angel gown with sweetheart bodice, satin sheen, full layered skirt, lace hem, white pumps, ethereal glow\",\"pose\":\"full-body centerpiece on the right, floating slightly, holding the skirt out with both hands in a graceful curtsy-like pose, hair and dress flowing to the right\"},\"layout\":{\"header\":{\"position\":\"top left to upper center\",\"visible_text\":[\"大天使\",\"キャワテポン\"],\"subtitle_ribbon\":\"AIイラスト投稿サイト『イロミライ』を見守り、みんなの創作を応援する天使♪\",\"typography\":\"large embossed gold Japanese calligraphy with ornamental swashes, white ribbon banner underneath with blue text\"},\"sections\":[{\"title\":\"PROFILE\",\"position\":\"left middle\",\"count\":11,\"rows\":[\"名前：大天使キャワテポン\",\"肩書：AIイラスト投稿サイト『イロミライ』の守護天使\",\"サイト：iromirai.jp\",\"誕生日・性別：6月10日（18歳）・女性\",\"身長：158cm\",\"好きなもの：かわいいもの、スイーツ、みんなの笑顔\",\"趣味：B級グルメ\",\"特技：レトロゲーム、掃除、片付け、整理整頓\",\"将来の夢：天使検定1級に合格すること！\",\"性格：明るくてやさしい、ちょっぴり天然\",\"口ぐせ：『あなたの未来を彩りたい』 チャームポイント：ふわふわの羽、きらめく笑顔、天使のティアラ\"]},{\"title\":\"CHARM POINT\",\"position\":\"bottom left\",\"count\":5,\"items\":[\"かわいさ\",\"神々しさ\",\"元気\",\"やさしさ\",\"キラキラ\"],\"visual\":\"gold ribbon title, two circular angel bust portraits above a pentagon radar chart, five icon circles around the chart: pink heart, blue crown, yellow sun, green heart, purple sparkle\"},{\"title\":\"MESSAGE\",\"position\":\"bottom center\",\"count\":1,\"text\":\"みんなの毎日を、もっとキラキラにするために舞い降りたよ♪ 応援も、ときめきも、ぜんぶまとめて届けるぽん！\"}],\"side_slogan\":{\"position\":\"right vertical\",\"text\":\"あなたの未来を彩りたい♪\",\"style\":\"vertical blue Japanese text with sparkle accent\"},\"bottom_slogan\":{\"position\":\"bottom edge\",\"text\":\"愛と笑顔で、世界をもっとハッピーに！\",\"style\":\"blue Japanese text centered with small gold stars\"},\"character_views\":{\"count\":4,\"views\":[\"one large full-body angel illustration occupying the right half\",\"one medium circular bust portrait at bottom left\",\"one small circular close-up portrait near lower middle-left\",\"one chibi full-body angel at bottom right with oversized head, tiny white dress, wings, tiara, halo, open arms\"]}},\"composition\":\"information-dense but airy character introduction sheet; keep all text panels legible, with gold divider lines, cream cards, blue accent text, and consistent celestial ornamentation; no dark colors; face area may be left softly simplified or blank if needed\",\"customization\":{\"site_name\":\"{argument name=\\\"site name\\\" default=\\\"イロミライ\\\"}\",\"domain\":\"{argument name=\\\"website domain\\\" default=\\\"iromirai.jp\\\"}\",\"main headline\":\"{argument name=\\\"main headline\\\" default=\\\"キャワテポン\\\"}\",\"catchphrase\":\"{argument name=\\\"catchphrase\\\" default=\\\"あなたの未来を彩りたい♪\\\"}\"}}","imgs":["https://r2.qqsrc.com/images/originals/18190.jpg"]},{"i":10170,"text":"Create a deliberately clumsy, childlike doodle illustration on a plain white background of a cute ghost-like ninja mascot named {argument name=\"character name\" default=\"Gold Mitama\"}. The character is bright {argument name=\"body color\" default=\"golden yellow\"}, with a rounded floating ghost body, a curled wisp of hair on top, a tapering ghost tail curling to the left, and simple thick black uneven outlines. Draw it in an intentionally bad MS Paint scribble style: shaky jagged lines, uneven coloring, visible white gaps, rough marker-like scribbles, flat colors, no realistic shading, low-detail amateur fan-art energy. The mascot wears a black ninja headband across the forehead with a tied knot and two flapping black cloth ends on the left; the front plate is gray and contains exactly 3 small triangular black symbols. Give the face half-lidded green eyes and a bored expression, with a skewer of exactly 3 dango balls held horizontally in the mouth: pink, white, and green. Add a purple scarf around the neck, with a colorful chest emblem made of overlapping rainbow-like blocks of blue, cyan, yellow, red, and green. On the left side behind the character, place a small sheathed sword or short ninja weapon with a brown handle and purple wrapping. On the lower right, show the character holding exactly 1 gray four-point shuriken with a circular hole in the center. Keep the composition centered, square, playful, messy, and intentionally poorly drawn, like a funny rough doodle generated from text only.","imgs":["https://r2.qqsrc.com/images/originals/18191.jpg"]},{"i":10171,"text":"Create a dreamy vertical anime fantasy illustration of {argument name=\"character description\" default=\"a petite teenage girl with dark brown hair in a tousled side ponytail\"} sleeping curled up on an enormous cratered crescent moon floating above a European gothic town at night. She wears {argument name=\"outfit style\" default=\"a black and navy Victorian military-lolita outfit with gold trim, short layered skirt, capelet, gloves, lace details, ribbon bows, and black ankle boots\"}, with a small ornate hat and crescent-shaped gold accessory in her hair. Her eyes are closed, expression peaceful, hands tucked near her face as if hugging the moon, legs folded comfortably along the lower curve. The crescent moon is large, pale ivory, rough and cratered, with 6 visible dangling gold chains and charms hanging from its lower edge: two star charms, one ornate diamond-shaped celestial pendant, and three small decorative drops. In the upper left sky, show a second bright full moon with a crescent-shaped bite missing from its right side, implying the sleeping girl has stolen a piece of the moon. The background is a deep cobalt-blue starry sky over a fairytale city of steep rooftops, lit windows, clock tower, spires, and distant castle silhouettes. Frame the scene as if viewed from an open window or balcony, with dark window edges on both sides, hanging green vines and leaves at the top, soft purple flowers and roses near the bottom, and a warm lantern glowing in the lower right foreground. Use cinematic moonlight, soft rim lighting, delicate painterly anime rendering, high detail, romantic magical atmosphere, depth of field, rich blues and golds, vertical composition, no text.","imgs":["https://r2.qqsrc.com/images/originals/18192.jpg"]},{"i":10172,"text":"{\"type\":\"high-energy anime commercial key visual for bottled natural mineral water\",\"format\":\"16:9 widescreen advertisement poster, glossy cinematic illustration\",\"brand\":{\"name\":\"{argument name=\\\"brand name\\\" default=\\\"雪峰の恵み\\\"}\",\"romanized_subtitle\":\"YUKIMINE NO MEGUMI\",\"logo\":\"sharp blue-and-white snow mountain emblem, placed in the upper right and repeated on the bottle label\"},\"main_subject\":{\"description\":\"young anime woman used as the commercial heroine, standing three-quarter view on the right side, long flowing silver-white hair with blue highlights, black over-ear headphones with a glowing blue N logo, blue X hair clip, black sporty water-resistant jacket with electric-blue accents and an N mark, pleated skirt hem visible, backpack straps, confident refreshing pose\",\"face\":\"intentionally covered by a plain vertical pale gray rectangle, like an anonymized placeholder mask\",\"action\":\"holding a clear plastic mineral water bottle toward the viewer in strong perspective with her right hand, left hand touching her headphones\"},\"product\":{\"count\":1,\"description\":\"large transparent crinkled PET bottle filled with sparkling clear water, blue cap, blue label, mountain logo, Japanese brand text, English text NATURAL MINERAL WATER, bright highlights and condensation\"},\"setting\":{\"environment\":\"dramatic North Alps mountain lake landscape with snow-covered peaks, deep blue sky, white clouds, glittering sunlight, splashing water arcs and floating droplets, green leaves flying in foreground\",\"mood\":\"fresh, pure, cold, energetic, premium Japanese beverage commercial\"},\"layout\":{\"composition\":\"left side packed with advertising copy and feature badges, right side dominated by the anime heroine and oversized bottle, diagonal water splashes guide the eye from mountains to product\",\"visible_text_sections_count\":7,\"sections\":[{\"title\":\"main headline\",\"position\":\"upper left\",\"count\":1,\"text\":\"{argument name=\\\"headline text\\\" default=\\\"澄みわたる、山のごちそう。\\\"}\",\"style\":\"large expressive Japanese brush calligraphy in dark cobalt blue with white glow\"},{\"title\":\"blue ribbon claim\",\"position\":\"left center under headline\",\"count\":1,\"text\":\"100%天然ミネラルウォーター\",\"style\":\"white sans-serif text on slanted blue banner\"},{\"title\":\"round origin badge\",\"position\":\"lower left above feature cards\",\"count\":1,\"text\":\"北アルプスの 天然水\",\"style\":\"white circular seal with blue border, mountain icon at bottom\"},{\"title\":\"feature cards\",\"position\":\"bottom left\",\"count\":3,\"labels\":[\"まろやかで飲みやすい\",\"ミネラル豊富\",\"自然にやさしいエコボトル\"],\"icons\":[\"water droplet\",\"mountain peaks\",\"heart\"],\"style\":\"three rounded white cards with blue icons and blue Japanese text\"},{\"title\":\"brand logo lockup\",\"position\":\"upper right\",\"count\":1,\"text\":\"雪峰の恵み / YUKIMINE NO MEGUMI\",\"style\":\"mountain icon above blue Japanese brand name and small roman letters\"},{\"title\":\"bottle label\",\"position\":\"right center on product\",\"count\":1,\"text\":\"雪峰の恵み / NATURAL MINERAL WATER\",\"style\":\"blue label wrapped around bottle with white mountain logo\"},{\"title\":\"handwritten slogan\",\"position\":\"lower right\",\"count\":1,\"text\":\"{argument name=\\\"slogan text\\\" default=\\\"今日も、いい自分に。\\\"}\",\"style\":\"white handwritten script with blue glow, angled upward\"}]},\"color_palette\":\"icy cobalt blue, bright white, transparent aqua, black clothing accents, fresh green leaves\",\"lighting\":\"intense summer sunlight, lens flares, star-like sparkles on water and bottle, high contrast glossy anime rendering\",\"style_keywords\":\"Japanese anime advertising art, beverage CM poster, ultra-detailed, dynamic perspective, crisp line art, vibrant saturation, clean commercial typography, sparkling water effects\",\"customization\":{\"water origin\":\"{argument name=\\\"water origin\\\" default=\\\"North Alps\\\"}\",\"hero accent color\":\"{argument name=\\\"hero accent color\\\" default=\\\"electric blue\\\"}\"}}","imgs":["https://r2.qqsrc.com/images/originals/18195.jpg"]},{"i":10173,"text":"Using REFERENCE_0 as the sole inspiration, transform the ginger ale can into a polished Japanese game character design sheet. Anthropomorphize the can into a stern male samurai warrior, deriving the armor materials, colors, crest motifs, metallic highlights, red-and-gold accents, and green lacquered surfaces from the can design. Present it as a professional RPG concept-art reference page on a clean white background with thin divider lines and Japanese annotation text.\n\nCreate these discrete sections: 1 main character profile block at top left with the name {argument name=\"character name\" default=\"真田 錫一郎\"} and short Japanese bio text; 1 four-view turnaround across the top center labeled front, side, back, and half-body view; 1 large face close-up on the left; 1 weapon section showing exactly 2 weapon elements, a sheathed green katana and an unsheathed curved katana, plus a small circular guard detail; 1 clothing-parts detail section showing exactly 12 separate items: helmet, chest armor, shoulder armor, arm guard, collar, sleeve, shin guards, corded belt, waist armor, battle skirt, leg guard, and boots; 1 expression set showing exactly 4 bust portraits labeled normal, calm, battle-ready, and faint smile; 1 color palette showing exactly 6 swatches based on the can: deep green, black, metallic silver, gold, deep red, and white; 1 costume concept text block; and 1 dynamic action pose at bottom right with the character drawing his sword and cloth panels flowing dramatically.\n\nKeep the design language tied to the reference can rather than copying the beverage packaging literally: use the can’s emerald green as lacquered armor, silver aluminum as polished metal, red logo color as cords and trim, gold shield/crown elements as heraldic ornamentation, and white typography areas as cloth highlights. Make the sheet look like high-end Japanese fantasy game production art, detailed, realistic anime/semi-realistic rendering, crisp linework, accurate armor construction, readable layout, and no photographic countertop background. Use {argument name=\"sheet title\" default=\"四面図\"}, {argument name=\"expression title\" default=\"表情集\"}, {argument name=\"parts title\" default=\"衣装パーツ詳細\"}, and {argument name=\"palette title\" default=\"カラーパレット\"} as visible Japanese section headings.","imgs":["https://r2.qqsrc.com/images/originals/18196.jpg"]},{"i":10174,"text":"{\"type\":\"fictional Japanese gyaru teen fashion magazine cover illustration\",\"format\":\"vertical glossy print magazine cover, full bleed, high-energy shoujo pop design\",\"masthead\":{\"text\":\"{argument name=\\\"magazine title\\\" default=\\\"ポップ☆キャンディ\\\"}\",\"romanized_subtitle\":\"Pop☆Candy\",\"style\":\"huge hot-pink bubble lettering with white fill highlights, black shadow, star symbol, playful crown and CD doodles above\"},\"main_subject\":{\"description\":\"one anime teen fashion model in punk-summer gyaru style, seated diagonally across the cover, leaning toward the viewer and making a large peace sign with her left hand\",\"face\":\"intentionally covered by a flat opaque tan rectangle centered over the face, as if anonymized or censored\",\"hair\":\"{argument name=\\\"hair color and style\\\" default=\\\"glossy chestnut-brown twin ponytails with red ribbon ties, blunt bangs, long curled ends\\\"}\",\"pose\":\"dynamic crouched sitting pose, one knee forward, body angled, playful confident magazine-cover energy\",\"outfit\":{\"count\":8,\"pieces\":[\"black cropped studded biker jacket with pins and patches\",\"white graphic crop T-shirt with pink-black skull logo\",\"frayed blue denim mini skirt\",\"black studded belt with silver chain and pink star charm\",\"black-and-white striped thigh-high sock on one leg\",\"black thigh band on the other leg\",\"black-and-pink chunky sneakers with star detail\",\"layered bracelets, earrings, choker, necklaces, rings, and pink nail art\"]}},\"visual_style\":{\"art_style\":\"polished anime illustration, glossy fashion-magazine rendering, vibrant pastel neon palette, detailed clothing textures, dramatic highlights, cute doodles and stickers\",\"palette\":\"hot pink, cyan, lavender, yellow, white, black, denim blue\",\"background\":\"busy pastel street-pop collage with hearts, stars, arrows, scribbles, stickers, check patterns, and graffiti-like shapes\"},\"layout\":{\"overall\":\"crowded Japanese fashion magazine cover with many overlapping typographic blocks around the model\",\"date_price_block\":{\"position\":\"upper right\",\"text\":\"5 / 2026 MAY / 670 yen\",\"style\":\"large pink issue number with small black date and price\"},\"top_banner\":{\"count\":2,\"items\":[\"small pink tagline at top left about fashionable girls\",\"yellow highlighted banner at top right reading a summer fashion special issue\"]},\"cover_lines\":{\"count\":12,\"items\":[\"large left headline about midsummer standout coordination and being ahead of trends\",\"pink left badge about Mana punk summer 7-day outfits\",\"three small schedule-strip captions on the left\",\"pink lower-left badge about a self-photography book supplement\",\"small speech bubble near the model about sunglasses instantly adding flair\",\"large bottom main headline: {argument name=\\\"main cover headline\\\" default=\\\"夏はじける! わたしがいちばんカワイイ♡\\\"}\",\"right pink circular feature about 10 summer keyword trends\",\"right article block about heavy rotation summer small-item catalog\",\"right street snap block advertising 100 street snaps\",\"lower-right yellow makeup lesson block\",\"small regional text near the street snap block\",\"tiny additional note reading and more\"]},\"callout_shapes\":{\"count\":4,\"items\":[\"purple oval label at left\",\"hot-pink circular burst at lower left\",\"pink circle at upper right\",\"yellow rounded rectangle at lower right\"]},\"inset_and_products\":{\"count\":4,\"items\":[\"one tilted small Polaroid-style inset photo at bottom left showing the same girl posing with peace signs, also face covered by tan rectangle\",\"one pair of pink sunglasses on the right\",\"one black studded hair accessory on the right\",\"one open pink makeup palette at bottom right\"]}},\"typography\":\"mix thick Japanese magazine fonts, brush-like handwritten captions, outlined neon display type, white strokes, black drop shadows, yellow highlight bars, pink hearts and star bullets\",\"quality\":\"crisp high-resolution cover art, print-ready, detailed but intentionally playful and cluttered\",\"custom_text_guidance\":\"Use the supplied Japanese text exactly for the masthead and main headline; other small cover lines may be stylized Japanese magazine text matching the design density.\"}","imgs":["https://r2.qqsrc.com/images/originals/18197.jpg"]},{"i":10175,"text":"Create a vertical smartphone screenshot-style anime fantasy scene with black app UI bars at the top and bottom. In the main image, show a dramatic low-angle view looking up through a ruined canyon of towering cracked stone walls under a vivid deep blue sky with bright white clouds and sunlight flaring from the upper right. A massive cubical stone block floats in the center near the top, made of many cracked rectangular slabs, with sharp rim lighting, chipped edges, and small debris fragments breaking off. Count 6 floating stone objects total: 1 enormous central cube, 1 medium rectangular block below-left of center, 1 small cuboid at upper right, 1 small cuboid near lower center, 1 small cube near bottom center, and 1 tiny distant block among the debris. Add dynamic dust, sparks, and motion streaks to make the block feel suspended or falling. Place bold vertical Japanese manga text with thick black fill, white outline, and warm glow: on the right side, {argument name=\"right vertical text\" default=\"どうだい？\"}; on the left side, {argument name=\"left vertical text\" default=\"壊してみないかい？\"}. The art style should be cinematic high-detail anime, saturated colors, extreme perspective, dramatic lighting, crisp stone texture, and a sense of awe and challenge. Include a minimal social-media viewer overlay: black top bar with a white X icon at top left and the number {argument name=\"top counter\" default=\"38\"} at top right, plus a black bottom bar with small like and dislike icons in a rounded dark pill and Android navigation symbols.","imgs":["https://r2.qqsrc.com/images/originals/18198.jpg"]},{"i":10176,"text":"Create a dramatic vertical fantasy concept art scene of a towering {argument name=\"warrior species\" default=\"anthropomorphic elephant\"} berserker in heavy steampunk armor, standing in a smoky battlefield. The character has gray wrinkled elephant skin, huge ears, long ivory tusks with metal bands, a raised curling trunk, and an open roaring mouth. Dress the warrior in layered dark gunmetal plate armor with brass trim, rivets, leather straps, shoulder guards, bracers, knee guards, a small riveted helmet, utility pouches, and ornate mechanical gears on the belt and chest. The warrior grips a massive two-handed chained mace: a long wrapped metal handle connected by a thick chain to an enormous spherical iron wrecking ball covered in rivets and sharp spikes. The mace head is a steampunk engine-like weapon with glowing orange furnace vents, exposed inner machinery, round exhaust ports blasting white steam, sparks flying from impact, and scorched metal panels. Show dust, debris, smoke plumes, embers, and motion energy around the weapon as if it has just smashed into the ground. Background: a ruined industrial battlefield with blurred broken structures, gray smoke columns, cloudy sky, and gritty war atmosphere. Use cinematic low-angle composition, hyper-detailed realistic rendering, sharp focus on the warrior and weapon, volumetric smoke, dramatic natural light, metallic reflections, warm orange glow contrasting with cold gray armor, epic dark fantasy mood. Main customization: {argument name=\"weapon type\" default=\"steam-powered spiked wrecking ball mace\"}, {argument name=\"armor style\" default=\"heavy brass-and-gunmetal steampunk plate armor\"}, {argument name=\"battlefield setting\" default=\"ruined smoky industrial war zone\"}, {argument name=\"mood\" default=\"ferocious epic battle roar\"}.","imgs":["https://r2.qqsrc.com/images/originals/18199.jpg"]},{"i":10177,"text":"Create a high-quality realistic anime-style 3D illustration of a young female tennis player on an outdoor tennis court in bright midday sunlight. She has {argument name=\"hair color\" default=\"short glossy chestnut-brown bob hair\"} with soft bangs, while her face is intentionally obscured by a smooth square blur censor block. Show her full body in a dynamic ready stance with legs spread wide, torso leaning slightly, right arm extended outward for balance, and left hand holding a blue-and-white tennis racket angled downward. She wears a fitted {argument name=\"tennis outfit color\" default=\"white\"} sleeveless athletic tennis dress with a scoop neckline, a pleated mini skirt, subtle blue sports logos on the chest and skirt, a white wristband with a small blue mark, white ankle socks, and chunky white tennis shoes with faint pastel blue accents. The scene is a blue hard-court tennis court with crisp white boundary lines, a tennis net behind her, a chain-link fence in the background, green trees beyond the fence, and a clear blue sky with soft white clouds. Use a slightly low, full-body portrait composition, shallow depth of field, realistic fabric folds, glossy hair highlights, soft skin shading, natural shadows on the court, vibrant summer colors, and polished gpt-image-2 photoreal anime rendering.","imgs":["https://r2.qqsrc.com/images/originals/18200.jpg"]},{"i":10178,"text":"Create a realistic full-body vertical portrait of an adult female track-and-field athlete standing upright and facing the camera against a plain gray concrete wall with circular form-tie holes. She has a fit, athletic build with toned shoulders, arms, waist, and legs, and wears a {argument name=\"uniform color\" default=\"deep red\"} two-piece competition uniform: a racerback sports crop top with white curved side stripes and small white athletic logos on the chest, plus matching low-rise running briefs with white side stripes and a small white logo near the hip. Her {argument name=\"hair color\" default=\"reddish brown\"} medium-length bob hair is softly styled with outward-flipped ends, and her face is covered by a centered rectangular pixelated privacy block in a skin-tone color. Use bright natural sunlight from the upper left, realistic skin shading, subtle shadows on the wall, sharp high-resolution detail, straight-on camera angle, cropped from head to mid-thigh, documentary sports portrait style, no text, no extra people, no props.","imgs":["https://r2.qqsrc.com/images/originals/18201.jpg"]},{"i":10179,"text":"Create a realistic full-body vertical outdoor sports portrait of an adult female track-and-field athlete standing front-facing against a gray concrete wall with visible seams, small holes, and subtle weathered texture. She has a sturdy, athletic-curvy build with broad shoulders, toned arms, a soft midsection, and strong thighs, posed upright with her hands clasped behind her back. Her face is intentionally anonymized by a large vertical rectangular mosaic/blur block in natural skin tones covering the entire face area, while brown hair is tied back in a low ponytail with loose side strands visible. She wears a {argument name=\"uniform color\" default=\"dark green\"} two-piece track uniform: a racerback sports crop top with white trim and side panels, plus matching brief-style athletic bottoms with white side stripes, both with small white athletic logos. Use natural daylight, sharp documentary photo realism, realistic skin texture, slight perspiration sheen, centered composition, portrait orientation, medium telephoto perspective, and a neutral candid sports-club look. Background should remain simple and uncluttered, emphasizing the single athlete and the concrete wall.","imgs":["https://r2.qqsrc.com/images/originals/18203.jpg"]},{"i":10180,"text":"Create a highly realistic miniature diorama photograph of a cute anime-style {argument name=\"character type\" default=\"Japanese schoolgirl figure\"} standing centered on a modern city sidewalk in bright daylight, posed full body facing the camera with both hands raised in cheerful peace signs. She has {argument name=\"hair color and style\" default=\"short light brown bob hair with a small top ponytail\"}, a softly blurred featureless face, slim proportions, and wears a navy school blazer with white piping and crest badge, white shirt, red necktie, red tartan pleated skirt, navy ankle socks, and glossy brown loafers. The scene is a detailed urban street diorama with a cafe building on the left, a large white “CAFE” sign, blue awning, warm interior lights, potted plants, and one chalkboard menu listing four items: “Coffee,” “Latte,” “Cappuccino,” and “Cake.” Add a black streetlamp with a red vertical banner reading {argument name=\"banner text\" default=\"WELCOME TO CITY\"}, leafy green trees lining the sidewalk, tactile yellow paving strips, tiled pavement, short metal bollards, a crosswalk and road on the right, metal guardrail in the foreground, glass office buildings and distant pedestrians in the background, plus additional red city banners and a billboard with a blurred portrait. Use a shallow depth of field, tilt-shift miniature effect, crisp foreground details, soft background blur, vibrant colors, realistic sunlight and shadows, 4:3 landscape composition, eye-level camera, photorealistic toy-figure diorama aesthetic.","imgs":["https://r2.qqsrc.com/images/originals/18204.jpg"]},{"i":10181,"text":"Create a realistic vertical smartphone-style portrait photo of an adult female track athlete standing front-facing against a plain gray concrete wall with visible panel seams, small circular form-tie holes, and subtle weathered texture. She has a soft, curvy athletic build and fair skin, with her arms held behind her back and shoulders relaxed, cropped from the top of the head to mid-thigh. Her hair is {argument name=\"hair color\" default=\"muted purple\"}, tied back loosely with a few strands around the ears. Her face is intentionally covered by a centered opaque rectangular censor block in a skin-toned mauve color, hiding all facial features. She wears a glossy {argument name=\"uniform color\" default=\"purple\"} two-piece track-and-field racing uniform: a racerback sports crop top and matching briefs, both with metallic silver-gray side panels, thin white curved piping, and small white swoosh-like athletic logos on the chest and hip. The pose is neutral and documentary-like, evenly lit by soft outdoor daylight, with realistic skin texture, fabric wrinkles, slight shadows under the arms and torso, and natural perspective. Use a clean candid sports portrait aesthetic, high-resolution photorealism, shallow but not blurry depth of field, no text, no extra people, no props.","imgs":["https://r2.qqsrc.com/images/originals/18205.jpg"]},{"i":10182,"text":"Create a highly realistic miniature diorama-style action figure scene of {argument name=\"character name\" default=\"an anime-style female tennis player\"} on an outdoor blue hard tennis court in bright midday sunlight. The subject is a glossy collectible figurine with smooth plastic-resin skin, athletic curvy proportions, and short windblown {argument name=\"hair color\" default=\"dark brown\"} bob hair; her face is intentionally obscured by a soft square blur. She is captured mid-sprint during a tennis rally, leaning forward dynamically with one leg extended toward the camera and the other kicked back, holding a blue tennis racket in her right hand while reaching her left arm outward for balance. Dress her in a fitted {argument name=\"outfit color\" default=\"white\"} sleeveless tennis tank dress with a low neckline, pleated skirt flaring from motion, white wristband with a small blue logo, white ankle socks, and chunky white tennis shoes with pale blue accents. Place one bright yellow-green tennis ball in the left foreground, motion-blurred and close to the camera. Add a tennis net across the midground, a dark green scoreboard in the left background showing Player 2, Game 30, 3 and 15, chain-link fencing, leafy green trees, and a vivid blue sky with soft white clouds. Use shallow depth of field, cinematic sports photography framing, low camera angle, strong sunlight highlights, crisp shadows, tiny dust or court particles spraying near the front foot, realistic court texture, and a polished toy-photography / 3D-rendered diorama aesthetic.","imgs":["https://r2.qqsrc.com/images/originals/18206.jpg"]},{"i":10183,"text":"Create a cinematic hyper-realistic miniature diorama scene on a rainy rooftop in a dense modern city, shot at low eye level with shallow depth of field. A single male operative in a wet black suit, white shirt, black tie, and black gloves lies prone on slick reflective stone tiles, aiming a large futuristic suppressed sniper rifle labeled “WAA2000” with a small glowing red laser/indicator near the barrel; his face is deliberately obscured by a soft square blur. The rooftop contains exactly 4 prominent fixtures: one small red warning beacon glowing on the parapet at left, one industrial louvered ventilation unit behind the man, one heavy weathered metal door with a small inset panel at right, and one ribbed metal dome turbine on a square base in the lower right. The background is a blurred skyline of tall dark skyscrapers under dramatic storm clouds, with wet concrete, rusted pipes, grime, fallen leaves, puddle reflections, cool blue-gray color grading, moody noir atmosphere, high detail, realistic rain-soaked textures, and diorama-like scale-model precision. Use a {argument name=\"scene style\" default=\"cinematic hyper-realistic miniature diorama\"} look, a {argument name=\"weather\" default=\"rainy stormy evening\"} atmosphere, a {argument name=\"character outfit\" default=\"wet black suit with white shirt and black tie\"}, a {argument name=\"weapon label\" default=\"WAA2000\"}, and a {argument name=\"city backdrop\" default=\"dark blurred skyscraper skyline\"}.","imgs":["https://r2.qqsrc.com/images/originals/18207.jpg"]},{"i":10184,"text":"Create a highly detailed realistic miniature diorama photograph of a {argument name=\"character type\" default=\"anime schoolgirl figurine\"} standing on a polished octagonal wooden display base inside an elegant old library. The figure is full body, centered, posed shyly with knees slightly crossed and both arms hugging a dark green hardcover book to her chest. She wears a {argument name=\"school uniform color\" default=\"navy blue\"} blazer with white piping, gold buttons, a small crest patch, a white shirt, red necktie, red tartan pleated skirt caught in a slight motion flare, white knee-high socks, and black penny loafers. She has very long flowing {argument name=\"hair color\" default=\"glossy black\"} hair with a white headband, many loose strands curling outward dramatically as if lifted by a gentle breeze; her face is covered by a square soft blur censor block. The environment is a warm, richly detailed wood-paneled library with tall bookshelves packed with old leather-bound books, carved columns, an arched window glowing with golden afternoon light, wooden desks and chairs with green leather seats, two brass banker lamps with green glass shades, small stacked books, and a tiny potted plant. Use shallow depth of field, cinematic warm lighting, realistic wood grain, glossy reflections on the floor and display base, collectible figure proportions with smooth painted skin, extremely sharp craftsmanship, macro photography, vertical composition, premium diorama realism, no text.","imgs":["https://r2.qqsrc.com/images/originals/18208.jpg"]},{"i":10185,"text":"Draw a single-panel black-and-white manga portrait of a young woman in a close-up three-quarter view, looking back over her shoulder toward the viewer with a calm, slightly distant expression. She has {argument name=\"hair color\" default=\"solid black ink\"} hair gathered into a loose low bun at the back-left of her head, with many thin flyaway strands, messy wisps around the ear and neck, and a few long strands crossing her face. Her face is pale white with minimal shading, a long elegant neck, soft narrow jawline, small understated mouth, and a tiny nose indicated by only a few strokes. Make the eyes the main distinctive feature: almond-shaped, refined, slightly sleepy, with unusual sharp irises and delicate pupils, individuality level 8/10, avoiding generic anime eyes; eyelashes are short, simple, and sparse. Use expressive hand-drawn line art that feels human and imperfect, with varied line weight, confident rough sketch strokes, and visible artist hand habits. The composition is cropped tightly inside a thin black rectangular border, the head occupying the upper center and right side, the bun on the left, shoulder and robe-like garment entering from the lower left, and a diagonal gray halftone background block in the lower right. Keep the palette strictly monochrome black ink on white paper with subtle screentone shading under the jaw and in the diagonal background area. Style: elegant seinen manga illustration, fashion sketch sensibility, minimal but emotionally precise, airy negative space, no text, no color, no extra characters.","imgs":["https://r2.qqsrc.com/images/originals/18209.jpg"]},{"i":10186,"text":"Using the provided reference image, create a cleaned-up revised version of the same Taisho-romantic mystery game title screen. Preserve the overall composition, Japanese logo text, ornate UI frame, character placement, moonlit Ginza street setting, and all interface elements unchanged, including the 2 top circular buttons and the 6 bottom menu buttons labeled 「はじめから」, 「つづきから」, 「記録」, 「設定」, 「資料室」, and 「特典」. Redraw the linework and repaint the colors for a sharper, higher-quality illustration with clearer edges, richer but still dark antique tones, and more polished lighting. Correct the streetcar so it has a more believable vintage tram shape, perspective, windows, rails, and front details. Greatly reduce GPT-image-style tiny dot garbage, speckle noise, random artifacts, muddy textures, and messy broken lines while keeping the cinematic nighttime atmosphere, falling petals, wet pavement reflections, newspapers, mask, pocket watch, telescope, pen, and decorative border.","imgs":["https://r2.qqsrc.com/images/originals/18210.jpg"]},{"i":10187,"text":"Create a detailed cozy anime illustration of exactly 2 cute fantasy girls studying in a bright white-background room, rendered in delicate ink lines, muted watercolor shading, soft gray-brown tones, and teal/purple accents. On the left, show {argument name=\"witch girl\" default=\"a shy black-haired witch girl\"} seated at a dark wooden writing desk, wearing an oversized black pointed witch hat decorated with tiny stars, buckles, purple flowers, chains, and ribbons; she has long wavy black hair in thick braids, pale skin, purple eyes, a black-and-white gothic dress with puffy sleeves, black stockings, and buckle shoes. She writes with a purple feather quill while resting her chin on one hand. On the right, show {argument name=\"halo girl\" default=\"a cheerful silver-haired halo girl\"} sitting curled up in a cushioned armchair, smiling with bright teal eyes, short messy silver hair, small teal hair clips, and a glowing blue-white halo above her head; she wears a futuristic white-and-black oversized hoodie with teal details, shorts, black socks, chunky white sneakers, and an ID-style tag, holding a clipboard and pen as if taking notes. Include a whimsical speech bubble above her containing exactly 1 small lightbulb icon. The study area should contain exactly 1 wooden desk, 1 wooden chair, 1 cushioned armchair, and 1 small round side table. On and around the desk include exactly 1 brass globe, 1 hanging lantern with a warm candle glow, 1 purple potion flask, 1 ink bottle, 1 feather quill, 1 closed black spellbook on the desk, scattered handwritten papers, and 1 stack of 3 dark books on the floor. Add wall details with exactly 2 pinned parchment notes and exactly 1 hanging trailing vine in a small wall frame. In the background, place exactly 1 low bookshelf holding several books, 1 geometric crystal orb, and 1 potted spiky plant. Near the right chair, include exactly 1 panda-faced backpack with teal eyes and bow, 1 small black round plush creature, exactly 1 open book on the floor, several loose pages, exactly 1 mug with a cute face on the side table, and exactly 1 potted leafy plant beside it. Use a charming slice-of-life magical academy mood, clean composition, soft shadows, lots of tiny decorative details, crisp character design, no text, no watermark, no photorealism.","imgs":["https://r2.qqsrc.com/images/originals/18211.jpg"]},{"i":10188,"text":"Create a luxurious Japanese advertising banner for {argument name=\"product name\" default=\"NÉBA\"}, premium fermented soybeans/natto, in a dramatic dark purple and black studio setting with radiant gold light trails, glittering particles, and an elegant high-end cosmetics/jewelry aesthetic. The composition is a square promotional visual: on the right, a transparent faceted crystal octagonal jar is open, overflowing with glossy amber-brown natto beans; long sticky golden strands stretch upward and swirl like luminous silk threads, with individual beans suspended in the strands. The jar has a dark plum label with gold typography reading {argument name=\"product name\" default=\"NÉBA\"}, small Japanese premium-product copy, and a refined floral emblem. Behind it, the open crystal lid stands upright with the same gold logo, resembling a luxury perfume or gem case. On the lower left, show a bowl of white rice topped with natto, green onion rings, a dab of mustard, and a dramatic splash of dark sauce shaped like a crown. Use large elegant Japanese headline text on the left reading {argument name=\"headline text\" default=\"ねばりが、美学になる。\"}, with the word for beauty in oversized gold calligraphy and the rest in white. Below it, include smaller Japanese body copy reading {argument name=\"body copy\" default=\"糸まで、美しい。架空のプレミアム納豆、誕生。\"}. Add a large serif Roman product title “NÉBA” with the subtitle “PREMIUM FERMENTED SOYBEANS” beneath it. At the bottom right, place a slim dark rectangular call-to-action button with a gold border, Japanese text reading {argument name=\"call to action\" default=\"気になるなら、まず一粒。\"}, and a right arrow. Overall style: ultra-polished luxury food commercial, hyper-detailed 3D product rendering, glossy reflections, faceted glass refraction, cinematic gold rim lighting, premium Japanese typography, intentionally over-the-top and not practical as an informational banner.","imgs":["https://r2.qqsrc.com/images/originals/18212.jpg"]},{"i":10189,"text":"Create a deliberately crude, childlike digital doodle on a plain white background, as if drawn quickly with thick black marker and rough scribbled fills. Show a small concert scene with exactly 2 people: on the left, a seated pianist with short brown hair, pale skin, black sleeveless outfit, sitting on a simple black chair and playing a glossy black grand piano; in the center-right, a female singer standing beside the piano, wearing a striped black-and-white top and a long dark gray skirt, one arm raised high in a waving or triumphant pose. The singer’s face is anonymized with a square pixelated blur block. The grand piano is large and extends to the right, heavily scribbled in black, with the yellow Yamaha tuning-fork logo and the word “YAMAHA” visible on the side; include exactly 2 small yellow caster wheels under the piano. Add one handwritten Japanese annotation, {argument name=\"annotation text\" default=\"ヨッメ\"}, in large black characters near the upper right, with a black arrow pointing toward the singer. Use an intentionally messy amateur style with uneven proportions, shaky outlines, visible scribble strokes, minimal color palette of black, white, brown, gray, pale skin tones, red cheek accent, and yellow logo details, like a privacy-protecting humorous sketch of a live music concert.","imgs":["https://r2.qqsrc.com/images/originals/18213.jpg"]},{"i":10190,"text":"{\"type\":\"vertical Japanese manga page, cheerful slice-of-life comic\",\"format\":\"single page with 5 bordered panels, thick black gutters, clean digital anime line art, bright flat colors, cute family-friendly tone\",\"style\":{\"art\":\"modern chibi-influenced manga, rounded faces, expressive eyes, bold black outlines, simple cel shading\",\"palette\":\"sunny sky blue, fresh green garden, warm coral clothing, colorful koinobori streamers\",\"lettering\":\"hand-drawn Japanese manga speech balloons and orange sound effects with white outlines\"},\"setting\":\"suburban Japanese yard on a clear windy spring day, blue sky with small white clouds, shrubs, flowers, fence, house eaves and cardboard boxes\",\"main character\":{\"description\":\"young adult blonde woman with straight long hair and blunt bangs, large cyan eyes, coral-red short-sleeve shirt, dark blue jeans, red sneakers, upbeat motherly personality\",\"hair color\":\"{argument name=\\\"hair color\\\" default=\\\"pale blonde\\\"}\",\"shirt color\":\"{argument name=\\\"shirt color\\\" default=\\\"coral red\\\"}\"},\"supporting characters\":{\"count\":2,\"children\":[\"young boy with short black hair, green T-shirt, brown shorts, excited smile\",\"young girl with dark brown twin pigtails, pink dress, clasped hands, excited smile\"]},\"object\":{\"name\":\"{argument name=\\\"festival decoration\\\" default=\\\"koinobori carp streamer pole\\\"}\",\"details\":\"tall silver pole topped with a small pinwheel, three carp streamers arranged vertically: black carp on top, red carp in middle, blue carp on bottom; streamers billow strongly in the wind\"},\"layout\":{\"panel count\":5,\"panels\":[{\"position\":\"top left\",\"size\":\"square\",\"scene\":\"low-angle view of the woman from behind raising the pole while three carp streamers blow left-to-right in the sky; leaves swirl in the wind\",\"visible text\":{\"sound effect\":\"ヒュオォォ…\",\"speech\":\"いい天気で気持ちいいなー\"}},{\"position\":\"top right\",\"size\":\"square\",\"scene\":\"woman beside cardboard boxes in the yard, gripping a silver pole section and preparing the streamer; house roof and bushes behind her\",\"visible text\":{\"sound effect\":\"ガサッ\",\"speech\":\"よーし！こいのぼりを出すぞー！\"}},{\"position\":\"middle wide\",\"size\":\"full-width horizontal panel\",\"scene\":\"woman kneels and tightens the pole at ground level while boy and girl run up joyfully from the right, looking at the carp streamers above\",\"visible text\":{\"left speech\":\"よろこんでくれるとうれしいな…\",\"right speech\":\"わぁーっ！こいのぼりだー！！\",\"sound effect\":\"ググッ\"}},{\"position\":\"bottom left\",\"size\":\"square\",\"scene\":\"warm pink background with small flower motifs; the two children hug the kneeling woman affectionately, all three laughing with closed happy eyes and blush\",\"visible text\":{\"speech\":\"これからもすくすく元気に育ってね!!\",\"sound effect\":\"ぎゅーっ\"}},{\"position\":\"bottom right\",\"size\":\"square\",\"scene\":\"final proud pose: woman stands winking with hands on hips beside the completed koinobori pole, streamers flying brightly against blue sky, yellow emphasis rays\",\"visible text\":{\"speech\":\"よーし！完ぺき！\",\"sound effect\":\"ドヤッ\"}}]},\"composition requirements\":\"Maintain exact five-panel manga layout, readable Japanese text inside balloons, energetic wind motion, cute wholesome mood, no photorealism, no 3D rendering.\",\"customizable text\":{\"top right speech\":\"{argument name=\\\"setup speech\\\" default=\\\"よーし！こいのぼりを出すぞー！\\\"}\",\"bottom left speech\":\"{argument name=\\\"heartwarming message\\\" default=\\\"これからもすくすく元気に育ってね!!\\\"}\",\"final speech\":\"{argument name=\\\"final speech\\\" default=\\\"よーし！完ぺき！\\\"}\"}}","imgs":["https://r2.qqsrc.com/images/originals/18214.jpg"]},{"i":10191,"text":"Using the provided reference image as the brand and character base, transform the flat logo into a warm, cute 3D promotional image for a first-time marche food-stall appearance. Keep the same white cat mascot identity, yellow forehead patch, round yellow chest accent, smiling closed-eye expression, handmade hot dog shop theme, and the shop name {argument name=\"shop name\" default=\"R-GARDEN*Sui\"}. Place the mascot full-body in front of a cozy wooden festival stall at night, rendered as a soft plush toy character. Add a wooden arched shop sign across the top with the Japanese headline {argument name=\"headline text\" default=\"手作りホットドッグのお店\"}, the shop name, and small hot dog / coffee-bean style decorative icons inspired by the reference border. Give the mascot two food props: 1 hot dog in one paw and 1 spiral tornado potato skewer in the other. Add warm string lights, a striped awning, condiment bottles, shallow depth of field, and a friendly market-event atmosphere. Include exactly 2 chalkboard menu signs in front of the stall: left sign labeled {argument name=\"left board text\" default=\"Hot Dog\"} with a hot dog doodle, and right sign labeled {argument name=\"right board text\" default=\"Tornado Potato\"} with a spiral potato doodle. Use a cinematic square composition, golden lighting, high-detail 3D rendering, and an inviting SNS/event advertisement feel.","imgs":["https://r2.qqsrc.com/images/originals/18215.jpg"]},{"i":10192,"text":"Using REFERENCE_0 as the exact line-art base, colorize the illustration into a richly detailed hand-painted watercolor/gouache anime illustration. Preserve the original composition, perspective, character pose, café setting, furniture, bookshelves, window, plants, food, and all line details, but replace the grayscale pencil look with warm natural colors and painterly texture. Use a cozy vintage café palette: honey-brown wood, cream and gold kimono fabric, blonde hair, blue and multicolored books, green foliage, yellow flowers, warm pendant lights, coffee and pastries. Keep the masked face area as a flat plain rectangle with no facial features. Add depth through soft sunlight from the window, gentle highlights on glass and porcelain, layered shadows, visible brush strokes, and high-detail color accents while maintaining the delicate original linework.","imgs":["https://r2.qqsrc.com/images/originals/18216.jpg"]},{"i":10193,"text":"Create a vertical dark fantasy anime celebration poster in a dramatic electric-blue and black palette, featuring a single young anime woman floating diagonally through a storm of magical energy. She has long windblown {argument name=\"hair color\" default=\"black\"} hair, pale skin, a calm slightly melancholic expression, and a revealing gothic black outfit with thigh straps, seen partly behind the typography. Surround her with jagged lightning arcs, glowing blue flames, shattered glass-like fragments, swirling dark ribbons, luminous blue petals, and 4 distinct blue roses: one small rose at the lower left, one bright rose at the right of the number, one large rose near the lower right, and one dark rose at the bottom-right edge. Put large ornate glowing cursive neon lettering across the foreground, tilted with perspective and crackling edges, using 5 readable text elements: “{argument name=\"main thank you text\" default=\"Thank you for your attention!\"}” across the upper and middle area, “{argument name=\"milestone text\" default=\"Over 700\"}” huge in the lower middle, “{argument name=\"follower text\" default=\"followers!!\"}” across the lower area, and “{argument name=\"signature text\" default=\"from @kuso_seisakusyo\"}” small near the bottom. The typography should look like blue lightning calligraphy with a white-hot inner glow, cyan outer aura, and dark shadow, partially obscuring the character while remaining legible. Use high-contrast cinematic lighting, deep navy shadows, intense sapphire highlights, floating particles, motion blur, glossy fantasy illustration rendering, and a highly detailed gpt-image-2 anime key visual composition.","imgs":["https://r2.qqsrc.com/images/originals/18217.jpg"]},{"i":10194,"text":"Create a clean vertical promotional poster in a bright minimalist 3D isometric style on a warm off-white background. At the top, place a large bold rounded sans-serif headline reading {argument name=\"headline text\" default=\"Seedance 2.0 No More Waiting\"}, split across two lines, with a smooth gradient from blue and violet on the left through magenta to orange on the right. Below the headline, show a stylized miniature scene of a long queue of exactly 96 tiny diverse people waiting in line, forming a wide U-shaped curve that starts near the lower center foreground, bends to the right, and continues diagonally far into the left background. The people should wear casual clothing in muted oranges, blues, tans, browns, whites, and grays, with toy-like proportions and shallow depth of field so distant figures become softly blurred. Along the queue are exactly 14 simple white cubic booth-like buildings with flat roofs, small rectangular windows, and open doors, receding in perspective from the lower right foreground to the upper left background; the closest booth on the right has a small group entering. Place exactly 1 purple-uniformed staff member near the middle-right doorway, gesturing toward the entrance as if directing the crowd. Use soft studio lighting, gentle shadows, a premium tech-advertising look, lots of white space, and a subtle tilt-shift miniature effect. At the bottom center, place the {argument name=\"brand name\" default=\"HailuoAI\"} logo: a colorful circular spiral icon in pink, orange, purple, and blue followed by black modern wordmark text.","imgs":["https://r2.qqsrc.com/images/originals/18218.jpg"]},{"i":10195,"text":"Create a full-body, photorealistic image of a life-size anime-style PVC figurine of a cheerful gyaru schoolgirl standing on a sunny modern Japanese shopping street, with shallow depth of field and blurred pedestrians/buildings in the background. The character has very long, voluminous, wavy {argument name=\"hair color\" default=\"pastel pink\"} hair flowing around her shoulders and down past her waist, glossy plastic skin, exaggerated doll-like proportions, and a deliberately obscured face covered by a smooth square blur matching skin tones. She wears a Japanese school uniform consisting of exactly 6 visible outfit pieces: a white collared shirt, a red-and-black striped necktie, a pale yellow buttoned cardigan, a short red-and-black plaid pleated skirt, loose dark navy leg warmers, and chunky dark brown loafers. Pose her confidently facing the camera, one arm extended upward and outward holding a decorated selfie stick, the other hand lightly touching her hair. Include exactly 4 visible phone/accessory elements on the selfie stick: a jewel-covered pink smartphone case, a large glossy heart decoration, a dangling small heart charm, and a fluffy pink pom-pom keychain. Use bright midday sunlight, crisp shadows on the paved pedestrian walkway, realistic urban bokeh, high-detail figure texture, glossy toy-like finish, fashion doll photography, 85mm lens look, vertical composition, centered subject, vibrant kawaii colors, and a playful Harajuku/Shibuya street atmosphere. Customize the character as {argument name=\"character style\" default=\"pink-haired gyaru schoolgirl figurine\"} in {argument name=\"location\" default=\"a Japanese city shopping street\"} with {argument name=\"lighting\" default=\"bright sunny midday lighting\"}.","imgs":["https://r2.qqsrc.com/images/originals/18219.jpg"]},{"i":10196,"text":"{\"type\":\"Japanese Udemy course promotional thumbnail / social media banner\",\"aspect_ratio\":\"wide 16:9, 1200x675 style\",\"overall_style\":\"high-conversion online course ad, premium dark navy and black digital workspace background, glowing gold typography, cinematic lighting, sharp commercial compositing, dramatic contrast, bokeh particles, subtle tech UI squares and cloud/file icons\",\"main_subject\":{\"position\":\"right third\",\"description\":\"adult presenter from waist up wearing bright blue medical-scrub-like top, face intentionally blurred or covered by a soft rectangular mosaic for anonymity, curly vivid blue afro-style hair, one arm raised with index finger pointing upward, other arm holding a closed silver laptop against the body\",\"expression\":\"not visible due to face blur\",\"pose\":\"confident instructor pose pointing to the top-left offer banner\"},\"background\":{\"setting\":\"dark office or study room with shelves and storage boxes, warm desk lamp glow, floating digital folder and cloud motifs, scattered gold light particles and thin geometric lines\",\"mood\":\"organized, trustworthy, digital productivity\"},\"typography\":{\"primary_headline\":\"{argument name=\\\"main headline text\\\" default=\\\"情報整理で人生は変わる\\\"}\",\"headline_position\":\"large center-left, stacked in multiple lines\",\"headline_style\":\"oversized Japanese Mincho/serif type, gold gradient with bright outer glow and subtle shadow; the smaller connecting characters are white\",\"top_copy\":\"{argument name=\\\"top copy\\\" default=\\\"探し物をなくして、行動を取り戻す\\\"}\",\"top_copy_position\":\"top center-left in white Japanese serif text\",\"subheadline\":\"{argument name=\\\"course subtitle\\\" default=\\\"デジタル整理講座\\\"}\",\"subheadline_position\":\"below headline centered-left with thin horizontal gold divider lines\",\"offer_banner\":{\"position\":\"upper left below top copy\",\"shape\":\"red horizontal ribbon with angled ends and gold outline\",\"text\":\"{argument name=\\\"offer text\\\" default=\\\"Udemy講座 95%OFF\\\"}\",\"style\":\"white bold serif text, large 95%OFF emphasized\"}},\"layout\":{\"sections\":[{\"title\":\"top message\",\"position\":\"top center-left\",\"count\":1,\"labels\":[\"探し物をなくして、行動を取り戻す\"]},{\"title\":\"red discount ribbon\",\"position\":\"upper left\",\"count\":1,\"labels\":[\"Udemy講座 95%OFF\"]},{\"title\":\"main headline block\",\"position\":\"center-left\",\"count\":1,\"labels\":[\"情報整理で人生は変わる\"]},{\"title\":\"course subtitle block\",\"position\":\"lower center-left\",\"count\":1,\"labels\":[\"デジタル整理講座\"]},{\"title\":\"device feature strip\",\"position\":\"below subtitle\",\"count\":3,\"labels\":[\"PC\",\"スマホ\",\"クラウド\"]},{\"title\":\"bottom benefit cards\",\"position\":\"bottom row\",\"count\":3,\"labels\":[\"1日5分で整う\",\"7ステップで実践\",\"5/3 22:00まで\"]},{\"title\":\"round benefit badge\",\"position\":\"lower right overlapping laptop\",\"count\":1,\"labels\":[\"ムダな検索時間をゼロにして、時間と集中力を取り戻す\"]}]},\"graphic_elements\":{\"bottom_cards\":\"three rectangular dark cards with thin gold borders, each with one gold icon: clock icon for 1日5分で整う, checklist icon for 7ステップで実践, calendar icon for 5/3 22:00まで\",\"feature_strip\":\"dark elongated outlined plaque with small gold icons for desktop monitor, smartphone, and cloud followed by white text PC・スマホ・クラウドを標準機能だけで整える\",\"badge\":\"black circular seal with gold rim and laurel leaves, mixed white and gold Japanese text, placed over the presenter and laptop\",\"decorations\":\"glowing file folder icon at far left, small cloud icons, floating squares, gold sparkles and lens flare accents\"},\"color_palette\":\"black, midnight navy, luminous gold, white, crimson red, bright scrub blue, warm amber highlights\",\"composition\":\"left side dominated by text hierarchy and promotional information, right side dominated by human presenter; ensure all Japanese text is crisp, readable, correctly spelled, and arranged like a professional Udemy sale thumbnail\",\"negative_prompt\":\"no extra people, no unreadable gibberish, no distorted hands, no duplicated fingers, no random English text, no clutter covering the headline\"}","imgs":["https://r2.qqsrc.com/images/originals/18220.jpg"]},{"i":10197,"text":"{\"type\":\"Japanese business infographic chaos map\",\"language\":\"Japanese\",\"canvas\":\"16:9 landscape white background with navy blue title typography, thin gray grid lines, rounded rectangular panels, corporate consulting-slide aesthetic\",\"title\":\"{argument name=\\\"main title\\\" default=\\\"世界の主要自動運転プレイヤー　カオスマップ\\\"}\",\"subtitle\":\"{argument name=\\\"subtitle\\\" default=\\\"－自動運転エコシステムの全体像－\\\"}\",\"top_banner\":\"{argument name=\\\"top banner text\\\" default=\\\"自動運転の覇権は「車」から「運行OS＋データ」へ\\\"}\",\"layout\":{\"main_area\":\"large three-row matrix occupying the upper two thirds, with dark navy vertical tier labels at far left and company cards arranged horizontally\",\"bottom_area\":\"ecosystem structure diagram on the left and key takeaways box on the right\",\"right_sidebar\":\"orange-titled supporting technology and data providers panel spanning the Tier2 and OEM rows\"},\"main_sections\":[{\"title\":\"① Tier1\",\"position\":\"top row\",\"left_label\":\"覇権争いの中核（最重要プレイヤー）\",\"count\":16,\"subgroups\":[{\"title\":\"米国：プラットフォーム型（AI主導）\",\"count\":4,\"companies\":[\"Waymo\",\"Tesla\",\"Zoox\",\"Cruise\"]},{\"title\":\"中国：都市インフラ一体型（国家＋都市OS型）\",\"count\":4,\"companies\":[\"Baidu Apollo\",\"Pony.ai\",\"WeRide\",\"AutoX\"]},{\"title\":\"欧州・半導体系（技術基盤の中核）\",\"count\":5,\"companies\":[\"Mobileye\",\"NVIDIA\",\"BOSCH\",\"Continental\"]}],\"card_style\":\"each card has a recognizable logo at top, company name below, and 2 to 4 compact Japanese bullet points describing strategy and strengths\"},{\"title\":\"② Tier2\",\"position\":\"middle row\",\"left_label\":\"有力スタートアップ・準主役プレイヤー\",\"count\":8,\"companies\":[\"Aurora Innovation\",\"Nuro\",\"May Mobility\",\"Motional\",\"Wayve\",\"Scale AI\",\"Einride\"],\"card_style\":\"white company cards with logos and short Japanese bullet notes about trucks, delivery robots, shuttles, end-to-end AI, annotation, and logistics\"},{\"title\":\"③ 自動車OEM側\",\"position\":\"lower row\",\"left_label\":\"（日本企業の競争領域）\",\"count\":8,\"companies\":[\"TOYOTA\",\"Mercedes-Benz\",\"Volkswagen\",\"Hyundai Motor Group\",\"General Motors\",\"Nissan\",\"Honda\"],\"card_style\":\"white OEM cards with logos and Japanese bullet points about Woven/TRI, Drive Pilot, Cariad, Motional, Cruise, ProPILOT, Honda SENSING\"}],\"right_sidebar\":{\"title\":\"共通の技術・データ基盤を支えるプレイヤー\",\"position\":\"right side\",\"count\":4,\"categories\":[{\"label\":\"高精度地図・ロケーション\",\"count\":4,\"items\":[\"HERE\",\"HEXAGON\",\"mapbox\",\"tomtom\"]},{\"label\":\"センサー・LiDAR\",\"count\":4,\"items\":[\"Velodyne Lidar\",\"LUMINAR\",\"HESAI\",\"INNOVIZ TECHNOLOGIES\"]},{\"label\":\"データ・クラウド・通信\",\"count\":3,\"items\":[\"aws\",\"Microsoft Azure\",\"Google Cloud\"]},{\"label\":\"シミュレーション・開発支援\",\"count\":3,\"items\":[\"dSPACE\",\"Ansys\",\"foretellix\"]}]},\"bottom_left\":{\"title\":\"自動運転エコシステムの4層構造\",\"position\":\"bottom left\",\"diagram\":\"four stacked trapezoid layers in blue, green, yellow, and purple with white icons\",\"count\":4,\"layers\":[{\"label\":\"① AI・OS層（頭脳）\",\"description\":\"自動運転の知能・判断・学習を担う中核層\",\"examples\":\"Waymo / Tesla / Baidu / NVIDIA / Mobileye など\"},{\"label\":\"② 運行サービス層（サービス）\",\"description\":\"人やモノを運ぶサービスを提供する層\",\"examples\":\"Robotaxi（Waymo / Baidu / Pony.ai）/ 配送（Nuro）/ トラック（Aurora）など\"},{\"label\":\"③ 車両層（プラットフォーム）\",\"description\":\"自動運転車両の開発・製造を担う層\",\"examples\":\"トヨタ / VW / Hyundai / GM / その他OEM\"},{\"label\":\"④ 部品・半導体層（基盤技術）\",\"description\":\"センサー・半導体・制御技術などを提供する層\",\"examples\":\"Mobileye / NVIDIA / Bosch / Continental / 各種サプライヤー\"}]},\"bottom_right\":{\"title\":\"経営者向け示唆（Key Takeaways）\",\"position\":\"bottom right\",\"count\":3,\"takeaways\":[\"勝者は『自動車メーカー』ではない\", \"真の競争軸\", \"日本企業の選択肢\"],\"details\":\"include Japanese check-mark bullets explaining Waymo/Baidu/Tesla leadership, data/simulation/urban infrastructure integration, and Japanese company options A NVIDIA/Waymo, B build own OS, C use Chinese urban integration\"},\"footer\":\"small gray note at bottom: ※ 本カオスマップは主要プレイヤーの一例を示したものであり、すべての企業を網羅しているものではありません。（2024年5月時点）\",\"style\":\"dense but clean Japanese corporate strategy slide, authentic company logos, consistent spacing, navy headers, colored category bands, small readable sans-serif text, crisp vector-like design, high-resolution presentation infographic\",\"customization\":\"{argument name=\\\"date note\\\" default=\\\"2024年5月時点\\\"}\"}","imgs":["https://r2.qqsrc.com/images/originals/18221.jpg"]},{"i":10198,"text":"Create a luxurious vertical promotional poster for {argument name=\"product name\" default=\"GPT Images 2.0\"} in a cinematic 3D style. The composition shows a highly detailed mirrored mosaic chameleon perched on top of a large iridescent spiral seashell, both covered in tiny reflective tiles like a disco ball, catching peach, silver, teal, and pearl highlights. Place the shell in the lower center, angled slightly left with the spiral facing forward-left, and place the chameleon across the shell’s top facing right, with a curled tail, bead-like eye, raised crest, and delicate feet gripping the shell. Use a deep teal-to-navy gradient background with sparkling particle fields, starburst glints, dotted light trails, subtle orbital line arcs, and warm peach bokeh sweeping across the bottom. Add 5 visible text elements: the huge elegant serif word “{argument name=\"main title first line\" default=\"GPT\"}” across the upper left, the huge elegant serif word “{argument name=\"main title second line\" default=\"Images\"}” beneath it, the smaller serif version number “{argument name=\"version text\" default=\"2.0\"}” to the right of Images, the left-side tagline “{argument name=\"tagline\" default=\"Words are your vision.\"}” stacked in three lines, and the bottom-right brand mark “{argument name=\"brand name\" default=\"HailuoAI\"}” with a small rounded gradient spiral icon in pink, orange, purple, and blue. Typography should be refined, high-contrast, metallic pale silver with thin strokes and a fashion-magazine editorial feel. Lighting is glossy and magical, with strong specular reflections, soft volumetric glow, shallow depth of field, and premium AI-generation campaign aesthetics. Use portrait aspect ratio, polished advertising layout, no extra objects, no people.","imgs":["https://r2.qqsrc.com/images/originals/18222.jpg"]},{"i":10199,"text":"Create a realistic horizontal 16:9 product-advertising still for {argument name=\"product type\" default=\"wireless earphones\"}. Show a young Japanese woman sitting on a light-colored sofa in a bright modern living room, viewed from the side at medium close-up. She has dark hair tied in a loose bun and wears a cream knit sweater; her face is intentionally hidden by a plain beige rectangular privacy block centered over the face. A sleek black wireless earbud is visible in her right ear, and she holds a dark smartphone in her left hand while her other hand is raised gently near her chin, suggesting she is listening to audio. Use soft natural daylight from sheer white curtains on the left, a clean cozy interior, shallow depth of field, a small green plant blurred in the background, and a calm premium lifestyle mood. On the left side, add bold Japanese ad copy in black: {argument name=\"headline text\" default=\"すべてが進化した、\\n次世代のサウンド体験を。\"}. Beneath it add smaller black product text {argument name=\"product label\" default=\"ワイヤレスイヤホン\"}, followed by a prominent blue year {argument name=\"year text\" default=\"2026\"} and a small outlined rounded badge reading {argument name=\"badge text\" default=\"NEW\"}. Keep the typography crisp, modern, and minimal, with generous white space and the woman occupying the right half of the frame.","imgs":["https://r2.qqsrc.com/images/originals/18223.jpg"]}];